// Copy to Secrets.xcconfig (git-ignored) and fill in. Never commit the real key.
// Config.xcconfig includes this file; AppInfo.plist puts the value in Info.plist as GISTDAAPIKey.
// A key built in here ships inside the app, where anyone with the .ipa can read it: restrict it at its provider
// (GISTDA: allowed origin / quota; Mapbox: a public pk. token limited to the bundle id com.tcroof.internal).
// Or leave it empty and type the key in the app's Settings screen instead (kept in that device's Keychain only).
GISTDA_API_KEY =
// Mapbox public token (pk.…) for satellite site pictures; Info.plist MapboxAccessToken.
MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN =
